  "description": "When the system warned the world that it was coming a week in advance, Alex couldn’t have been more excited. He was ready for a new life… but he wasn’t ready for his best friend to shove him through a portal into hell the moment the apocalypse started. Alex finds himself stranded in a nightmarish world where even the bugs are stronger than he is. But not even that is enough to ruin the apocalypse he’s been waiting for. Where others see certain death, he finds something else entirely... Opportunity.\n\n(Source: Webtoon)",
